{"steam_appid":1411910,"steam_name":"Fallen Aces","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1411910/185556452/e4dc9ed29d5f10b9aef98a54e02e73c027edbad9/1785026722/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1785084311","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257385117/2c89b89ccdda2ab3224f386b3844540de9ecb59e/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1785084311","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/ss_805a9c1f30e97e232c80e5e0994fbc48120fb006.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785889856","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/2ace386e046ae462318d1350f18badc188fb7d68/ss_2ace386e046ae462318d1350f18badc188fb7d68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785889856","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/f3ce3eab19b7d85badffbb1d79681ba621b3e968/ss_f3ce3eab19b7d85badffbb1d79681ba621b3e968.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785889856","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/504f74775b8a526d12642518338c31f725b2e0db/ss_504f74775b8a526d12642518338c31f725b2e0db.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785889856","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/51ba85aed365b50680db79cf3ea04f621ce3a143/ss_51ba85aed365b50680db79cf3ea04f621ce3a143.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785889856"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Enter a world of heroes, villains, crime, corruption and betrayal!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Fallen Aces</i> is a FPS <i>crime noir</i> that plays right out of the '90s and looks right out of the comics.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/extras/6ba6778ea86eec8e7bdbdee7718dccee.poster.avif?t=1785889856\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/extras/6ba6778ea86eec8e7bdbdee7718dccee.webm?t=1785889856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/extras/6ba6778ea86eec8e7bdbdee7718dccee.mp4?t=1785889856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A gritty crime noir saga:</strong> spanning three episodes and <strong>dozens</strong> of levels, and featuring fully voiced <strong>hand drawn</strong> comic cutscenes - Fallen Aces tells a <i>real</i> story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world is your weapon:</strong> use fists, knives, pipes, bats, trash cans, frying pans, pistols, shotguns, nail guns, spear guns, Tommy guns and more to take back Switchblade City.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non linear level design:</strong> Choose your path, use <strong>stealth</strong>, go <strong>loud</strong> or <i>try a mixture of both!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hand drawn:</strong> 100% original hand drawn art and animation brings the game to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuggedaboutit!:</strong> Hundreds of lines of <strong>authentic</strong> period era gangster dialogue injects personality into the wide array of people and places in <i>Fallen Aces.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/extras/52fdb0375c1a2098d0babcaee142b3a8.poster.avif?t=1785889856\" width=780 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/extras/52fdb0375c1a2098d0babcaee142b3a8.webm?t=1785889856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1411910/extras/52fdb0375c1a2098d0babcaee142b3a8.mp4?t=1785889856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen Z1 (6 cores, 12 threads) @ 2.4 GHz to 3.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RDNA 2 or integrated graphics with at least 8GB of shared VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> How you doin?</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 7600 @ 3.8 GHz to 5.1 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia RTX 3060 or Radeon RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> You Some Kinda Wise Guy?</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["Trey Powell","Jason Bond"],"publishers":["New Blood Interactive"],"release_date":"14 Jun, 2024"}